00:26:08.700 --> 00:26:12.260
There are so many stairs you might consider pooping in the lake.

547
00:26:13.460 --> 00:26:16.780
Thankfully, it never came to that, but I'm just saying it was a climb.

548
00:26:16.960 --> 00:26:19.800
We tried hard to have everything we needed down on the dock.

549
00:26:20.300 --> 00:26:24.500
When we did need something from the house, I'd volunteer to go and get it as I decided

550
00:26:24.500 --> 00:26:28.600
