551
00:26:28.960 --> 00:26:32.720
All day long, we basically took turns riding the wave runner and swimming.

552
00:26:33.220 --> 00:26:36.080
Our dock also had a diving platform that the kids loved.

553
00:26:36.420 --> 00:26:39.720
Lots of near heart attacks for me watching them flip and dive off that thing.

554
00:26:40.020 --> 00:26:43.920
In the evening, we ordered takeout and watched the USA World Cup game together.

555
00:26:44.260 --> 00:26:48.120
