562
00:27:09.760 --> 00:27:14.220
Since this is literally one of my favorite things to do at the lake, I love knowing that detail.

563
00:27:14.720 --> 00:27:19.100
He also told me the man they hired to build the house was a drunk and they got into a ton

564
00:27:19.100 --> 00:27:19.600
of fights.

565
00:27:20.300 --> 00:27:22.100
