570
00:27:32.880 --> 00:27:33.680
Oh my goodness.

571
00:27:33.800 --> 00:27:34.200
Crazy.

572
00:27:35.340 --> 00:27:38.060
In other news, we met the neighbor next door to our rental.

573
00:27:38.360 --> 00:27:42.020
