584
00:28:05.620 --> 00:28:10.500
Lady, this must have made you so happy because she does the rescue work that you do.

585
00:28:10.500 --> 00:28:14.020
Yes, I wrote, we are not going to have to worry about these kitties.

586
00:28:14.160 --> 00:28:14.740
What a relief.

587
00:28:14.920 --> 00:28:17.120
It was really weighing on us this whole trip.

588
00:28:17.380 --> 00:28:18.760
